<Base title="About FormFix India" description="FormFix India is a free, browser-local document preparation tool for Indian online applications. No uploads, no registration, no payment.">
<h1 class="text-3xl font-extrabold">About FormFix India</h1><p class="mt-3 text-slate-700">FormFix India helps people fix the most common file problems in online applications: a photo that is too large, a signature outside the required range, or a PDF that will not upload. Every tool runs in your browser. There is no server upload, no account and no payment in this version.</p><p class="mt-3 text-slate-700">The site is independent. It is not affiliated with SSC, UPSC or any government department, and it does not use government logos to imply endorsement.</p>
</Base>
